WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.001 --> 00:00:04.952
This is the Openfund trading terminal.

2
00:00:05.002 --> 00:00:08.079
Start by connecting your wallet.

3
00:00:08.129 --> 00:00:11.158
Choose your wallet from the list.

4
00:00:11.208 --> 00:00:15.775
Sign in with a signature. It is not a transaction and costs no fee.

5
00:00:15.825 --> 00:00:19.781
You are signed in. Your wallet is your account.

6
00:00:19.831 --> 00:00:23.520
Open Accounts to see your Prop and Perpetual accounts.

7
00:00:23.570 --> 00:00:29.570
Choose your demo account to activate it for trading.

8
00:00:30.776 --> 00:00:36.776
Your account is active. You are ready to trade.
